 <h3><u>Musadas Hazrat e zahra</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Fatema Zahra, Fatema Zahra..(4)</p> 
  <p>Madha karni hai fatema ki mujhe..(2)<br> sahibe zulfiqar al-madade<br> bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra<br> dehne aayaat mein qur'aa ki zabaa'n hai zahra<br> misra e hazrat e chishti me nihaa'n hai zahra<br> dee'n hai shabbir to shabbir ki maa hai zahra<br> haq ki tableegh ke paighaam me kya rakha hai<br> ye jo hat jaye to islam mein kya rakha hai</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Lab e payghambar e akhir ka wazeefa zahra<br> chashme qur'aa se jo dekho to saheefa zahra<br> ismat o iffat o hikmat ka khazeena zahra<br> abd o mabood ke maa bayn waseela zahra<br> us waseele ki agar raah numayi na mile<br> khud rasoolo'n ki duao'n ko rasaayi na mile</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Ishq tauheed hai tauheed ka irfan hai yeh<br> ishq iqraar e nabuwat hai to eeqaan hai yeh<br> ishq hai khun ki ye dil khoon ka dauraan hai yeh<br> ishq eemaan hai eemaan ki pehchaan hai yeh<br> apne eemaa'n ko tazabzub se mubarra na kiya<br> wo kahi ka na raha jisne tabarra na kiya</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Farz e tehzeeb e aqeedat ko nibhana warna<br> ek reyaaya ki tarha sar ko jhukana warna<br> azmat e maadar e hasnain batana warna<br> be ijazat dar e zahra pe na aana warna<br> haq ne bakshi hai jo tauqeer wo jaa sakti hai<br> malakul maut tujhe maut bhi aa sakti hai</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Waah kya darr hai dar e bint e shehenshah e umam<br> ye sakhawat ye ataaein ye shifa'at ye karam<br> ye hai salman e muqaddas wo sulaiman e hasham<br> ye bulandi, ye buzurgi, ye falak aur ye hum<br> sar jhukate hai to azmat ka safar lagta hai<br> sar uthate hai to kausain se sar lagta hai</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Tere darr par tere hubdaar khade rehte hai<br> ambiya, auliya autaar khade rehte hai<br> haan mere jaise bhi gunehgaar khade rehte hai<br> hadd hai ye ahmad e mukhtar khade rehte hai<br> manzil e sidra pe jisko na jhijhakte dekha<br> us nabi ko teri dehleez pe rukte dekha</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Mohr e angushte wilayat pe nageena tera<br> malik e mulk ki daulat hai safeena tera<br> turbato'n mein jo nehaa hai wo khazeena tera<br> Karbala teri, Najaf tera, Madina tera<br> Riqqa o Mash'had o Kashaan o Halab tere hai<br> aasmaa'n jitne zameeno pe hai sab tere hai</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Hukm jo dediya tune wo nibhana hoga<br> khudko hasnain ka khayyat batana hoga<br> seeke malboos ko hasnain ke laana hoga<br> tune jab keh diya rizwan ko aana hoga<br> tere aage to mashiyat bhi nahi chal sakti<br> kuch bhi hojaye teri baat nahi tal sakti</p> 
  <p>bakhuda hakima e kaun o makaa'n hai zahra..(2)<br> Fatema Zahra, Fatema Zahra</p> 
